<div class="wp-block-group tt-wrap"><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tt-ilede"} -->
<p class="tt-ilede">Student welfare is the foundation of every study tour we operate. We combine strict staffing ratios, regular daily routines, and twenty-four-hour operational oversight to ensure every pupil is accounted for at every stage.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-sec tt-isec","layout":{"type":"default"},"align":"full"} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignfull tt-sec tt-isec"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-wrap","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-wrap"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brows sp-stagger","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brows sp-stagger"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-brow__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-brow__h">Staffing ratios and the daily routine</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow__b","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow__b"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We enforce a mandatory staffing ratio of one adult leader for every ten students on every excursion, with travelling teachers included in leader totals. On the road, each day follows an exact schedule to maintain order and security. Students wake at seven o'clock, followed by the morning breakfast headcount at seven thirty.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A departure headcount takes place at eight fifteen before vehicles move. Following lunch at twelve thirty and scheduled afternoon visits, the group returns for the evening headcount at seventeen forty. Evening messages go to families at twenty-one hundred hours, and lights out is enforced at twenty-two thirty.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-brow__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-brow__h">Preparations before every departure</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow__b","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow__b"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Safe tours depend on thorough preparation long before groups leave the school gates. We conduct site visits for accommodation and excursion venues to assess physical access, fire exits, and local transit links.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Our safety director compiles signed, site-specific risk assessments that satisfy governing bodies and educational visit coordinators. Every tour leader receives an operational briefing covering pupil medical conditions, dietary allergies, and emergency protocols, while teachers receive laminated emergency cards with key contacts.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

