<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-brow__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-brow__h">Emergency response and the twenty-four hour duty line</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow__b","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow__b"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If an unexpected event or illness occurs during a tour, leaders follow a clear escalation procedure rather than improvising. Our operational duty line at plus forty-four one six three two nine six zero four nine nine is answered twenty-four hours a day by senior staff in Ashby Vale.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A named coordinator liaises directly with local medical providers and transport operators. Should any significant incident arise, school leaders and parents are contacted directly within one hour, ensuring transparent, immediate communication.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-brow__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-brow__h">Proven experience since 2009</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow__b","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow__b"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Since Mara Lindqvist established Tabidachi Study Tours in 2009, we have coordinated six hundred and twelve school trips across the United Kingdom and continental Europe. We do not make reckless claims or rely on chance; instead, we depend on systematic procedures, trained personnel, and disciplined timekeeping. Every journey benefits from sixteen years of operational knowledge, making sure that every pupil boards in order and returns on schedule.</p>
